{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"ulcerative-confined-blacklemur","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Summary\n\nDiscovered while validating bug 751a's review_ticket retarget via a live 'Live External Integration' workflow_dispatch (run 31856166064). The 'external LLM (live bedrock)' lane failed on ONE test, unrelated to the review_ticket retarget:\n\n    tests/external/test_completion_banking_behavior_0707.py::test_dense_completion_banks_and_terminates_in_two_of_three_trials\n\nwith:\n\n    rebar.llm.errors.LLMError: completion verification workflow did not produce a verdict: step 'decide@then/verify' failed: the LLM provider call failed: _observe_trial.<locals>.observed_upsert() got an unexpected keyword argument 'evidence_sufficient'\n\nSame run: 17 passed, 1 failed on the bedrock arm; the anthropic and openai LLM arms and the langfuse round-trip lane were fully GREEN. So this is arm-flaky or a signature drift in the completion-verifier trial-observation path (_observe_trial.<locals>.observed_upsert), NOT the review_ticket removal.\n\n## Root cause (to investigate)\n\nA caller passes evidence_sufficient=... into the nested observed_upsert() closure defined in _observe_trial (completion-verifier recovery path, around src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_recovery.py), whose signature does not accept it. Likely a param added on one side of the upsert closure without threading it through the closure definition.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] observed_upsert() accepts/threads evidence_sufficient (or the caller stops passing it), so decide@then/verify produces a verdict.\n- [ ] test_dense_completion_banks_and_terminates_in_two_of_three_trials passes on the bedrock arm of Live External Integration.\n\n## Testing\n\n- pytest -m 'external and llm_live' tests/external/test_completion_banking_behavior_0707.py on the bedrock arm (live creds).\n- A workflow_dispatch of 'Live External Integration'.","id":"9c7c-4844-f53c-4eac","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["ci","external-tests","bedrock"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"External bedrock lane: completion verifier observed_upsert() got unexpected kwarg 'evidence_sufficient'"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786757563070332001,"uuid":"8ec4a8f3-9147-49b1-8ad0-851778ca7d69"}